WEBVTT

00:03.490 --> 00:05.320
Never forget your poker face.

00:05.320 --> 00:09.410
With his father's teachings in his heart, the miraculous magician glides through skyscrapers.

00:09.410 --> 00:11.330
Enter Kaitō Kid!

00:11.330 --> 00:15.040
Today's target is the world's largest pink sapphire.

00:15.040 --> 00:17.210
Now, it's show time!

00:17.420 --> 00:22.130
kimi no namida ni kon’na ni koishite’ru

00:17.420 --> 00:22.130
I love your tears so much

00:22.130 --> 00:24.720
Whoa, this summer day, summer night

00:24.720 --> 00:28.300
soba de waratteitai yo

00:24.720 --> 00:28.300
I want to laugh by your side

00:35.890 --> 00:40.320
bōhatei atsui sunahama

00:35.890 --> 00:40.320
On a pier on a warm sandy beach

00:40.320 --> 00:45.570
machiwabita kiseki yatto otozureta

00:40.320 --> 00:45.570
The miracle I longed for finally came true

00:46.780 --> 00:50.910
dōka kono mama stay with me

00:46.780 --> 00:50.910
Please, stay with me, just like this

00:50.910 --> 00:54.370
Everything for you, I’ll always think of you

00:57.000 --> 01:01.040
hoshi furu yoru wa koishikute

00:57.000 --> 01:01.040
I miss the nights with shooting stars

01:01.040 --> 01:05.670
negai komete koe no kagiri utau no

01:01.040 --> 01:05.670
I wish and sing with all of my voice

01:06.970 --> 01:11.350
mō tomerarenai my sweet song

01:06.970 --> 01:11.350
I can’t stop my sweet song anymore

01:11.350 --> 01:16.850
nakisō na koe de I love you

01:11.350 --> 01:16.850
In a tearful voice I cry ‘I love you’

01:16.850 --> 01:21.360
koe ni naranai hodo hito o suki ni nari

01:16.850 --> 01:21.360
When you like someone so much that you can’t verbalise it

01:21.360 --> 01:23.940
Whoa, this summer day, summer night

01:23.940 --> 01:26.610
nanimo kamo ga takaramono

01:23.940 --> 01:26.610
Everything’s a treasure

01:26.610 --> 01:26.950
Baby...

01:26.950 --> 01:31.660
kimi no egao ga kon’na ni yūki kureru

01:26.950 --> 01:31.660
Your smile gives me so much courage

01:31.660 --> 01:37.000
hakanaku itoshii kono kimochi dakishimete

01:31.660 --> 01:37.000
as I embrace this fleeting love

01:37.000 --> 01:44.090
kimi no yokogao zutto zutto mitsumete’ta

01:37.000 --> 01:44.090
I’ve always, always been watching you from your side.

02:01.270 --> 02:04.480
A Witch, a Detective, and a Phantom Thief

02:16.240 --> 02:16.990
News

02:16.240 --> 02:16.990
Yet another notice from Kaitō Kid!

02:16.240 --> 02:16.990
On Aug. 21st, Kaitō Kid sent an assault notice targeting
the main event held at the Incan Museum on Sep. 29th.

02:16.240 --> 02:16.990
As suggested by the name 'Phantom Thief', Kaitō Kid issues
written crime notices and uses brilliant tricks to steal what
he sets his eyes upon. His usual targets are jewels.
He first appeared in Paris 18 years ago, and although he hid
himself eight years ago, he recently resumed his activities in
Japan. He appears as if from nowhere and vanishes without
trace, and specialises in magic and disguises. His true title is
'Phantom Thief #1412', a secret number that a police
organisation (rumoured to be Interpol, the FBI, or the CIA,
but it is not conclusively known) confidentially assigned him,
which then leaked out and became the name he is referred to
as. However, in Japan, a young novelist (Yūsaku Kudō) who
twisted the police from every country around his fingers like
they were children, and held an interest for Phantom Thief
#1412, read the numbers '1412' that a newspaper reporter
had scribbled as 'KID' as a joke, which then stuck (it was actually a mere misreading) and Phantom Thief #1412 became known as 'Kaitō Kid'. He is also called the 'Modern Age Lupin' and the 'Moonlight Magician' by the media.

02:16.990 --> 02:17.040
News

02:16.990 --> 02:17.580
Yet another notice from Kaitō Kid!

02:16.990 --> 02:17.830
On Aug. 21st, Kaitō Kid sent an assault notice targeting
the main event held at the Incan Museum on Sep. 29th.

02:16.990 --> 02:17.830
As suggested by the name 'Phantom Thief', Kaitō Kid issues
written crime notices and uses brilliant tricks to steal what he
sets his eyes upon. His usual targets are jewels.
