actually a mere misreading) and Phantom Thief #1412
became known as 'Kaitō Kid'. He is also called the 'Modern
Age Lupin' and the 'Moonlight Magician' by the media.

02:27.050 --> 02:29.050
What a boring show.

02:39.680 --> 02:43.100
Hold it! Kaitō Kid!

02:43.100 --> 02:47.030
See ya tomorrow, Inspector Nakamori!

02:47.030 --> 02:49.440
We were played again.

02:49.440 --> 02:52.610
Of the three-night serial notice, this is our second defeat.

02:52.610 --> 02:54.070
Inspector! It happened again!

02:54.070 --> 02:54.990
I know!

02:54.990 --> 02:58.290
Oh, no… We were <i>not</i> defeated again. Look!

02:58.950 --> 03:03.170
Just like last time, it was returned to the place where it was supposed to be stolen from!

03:03.170 --> 03:06.960
What is Kid thinking? Showing up but not stealing…

03:06.960 --> 03:08.920
What's he after?!

03:09.800 --> 03:12.090
I'll unmask him, no matter what!

03:12.090 --> 03:14.680
You'll soon learn who he is.

03:14.680 --> 03:17.470
H-Hakuba-<i>kun</i>! When did you…

03:17.470 --> 03:22.310
Even if you're the Superintendent General's son,
you can't keep coming to crime scenes…

03:22.310 --> 03:23.690
Inspector Nakamori…

03:23.690 --> 03:26.400
What in the world have you been doing?

03:27.400 --> 03:30.990
A clue was left behind that's both simple and significant.

03:31.740 --> 03:33.110
A lock of hair.

03:33.110 --> 03:34.450
Belonging to Kaitō Kid.

03:37.410 --> 03:42.120
If I find out who Kid is, I can get closer to Spider.

03:44.040 --> 03:49.000
Once he's done with his Europe tour,
he'll soon sneak his way to Japan.

03:49.960 --> 03:51.510
Out of the way, out of the way!

03:51.510 --> 03:55.430
Detective Hakuba! Kid got away again, any comments?!

03:59.350 --> 04:01.270
So, where are we going?

04:01.270 --> 04:03.560
You'll know when we get there, Inspector.

04:12.820 --> 04:15.780
Magic ball, heed my call!

04:15.780 --> 04:18.740
Who's the fairest of them all?

04:18.740 --> 04:22.040
Thou, Lady Akako, art the fairest of all.

04:25.960 --> 04:29.670
All the men in the world are captivated by you.

04:29.670 --> 04:33.090
That is, except for Kaitō Kid.

04:33.800 --> 04:35.300
Kaito Kuroba!

04:35.300 --> 04:37.720
When will you be captivated by me?!

04:37.720 --> 04:38.890
C-Calm down!

04:38.890 --> 04:40.350
It's not much longer!

04:40.350 --> 04:43.220
He'll become captivated by me, right?

04:43.220 --> 04:45.140
That's impossible.

04:45.140 --> 04:48.770
Even for a sorceress like yourself…

04:49.560 --> 04:50.900
W-Wait!

04:50.900 --> 04:55.320
I meant it's not much longer until
he disappears from your sight!

04:55.320 --> 04:56.950
D-Disappears?

04:58.660 --> 05:01.120
Yes. As you can see here.

05:01.120 --> 05:03.790
T-This is… What does this mean?

05:10.170 --> 05:13.590
This guy?! The transfer student, Saguru Hakuba…

05:23.350 --> 05:26.270
What a fine establishment.

05:26.730 --> 05:29.230
But what in the world is this…

05:29.230 --> 05:31.150
It's my uncle's laboratory.

05:37.110 --> 05:39.200
Now, take a look.

05:39.200 --> 05:42.080
This is the data that I've collected on Kid so far.

05:42.080 --> 05:47.460
Kaitō Kid: Height: 174 centimetres. Weight: 50 kilograms.

05:47.460 --> 05:50.040
Eyesight: Left 2.0, Right 2.0.

05:50.040 --> 05:52.500
Mimic-able voices: countless. Great at sports.

05:52.500 --> 05:55.590
He can concentrate well, but has no willpower.

05:55.590 --> 05:57.300
Also, he's got a nasty personality.

05:57.300 --> 06:00.050
Young master Saguru, the hair examination is complete!

06:00.050 --> 06:01.550
Oh, I see.

06:01.550 --> 06:06.560
Hair: black. Race: Japanese. Blood type: B.

06:06.560 --> 06:08.980
E-Estimated age…

06:09.730 --> 06:10.850
What's the matter?

06:10.850 --> 06:15.280
Oh, he's probably in his late-30s or 40s.

06:15.280 --> 06:18.110
Or perhaps he's in his 50s?

06:18.110 --> 06:21.700
E-Estimated age: 15-17…

06:22.990 --> 06:25.240
Oh, so he's still in high school.

06:25.240 --> 06:27.620
Wait, there's no way he's in high school!

06:27.620 --> 06:30.120
I've been after him since I was in my 20s!

06:30.120 --> 06:32.330
What nonsense. I'm leaving!

06:32.330 --> 06:36.050
Kid's scheduled to appear tomorrow
night too, so I'm very busy!

06:39.720 --> 06:43.140
Young Master, this is probably some kind of mistake.

06:43.140 --> 06:46.720
You said there were all kinds of data gathered here, right?

06:46.720 --> 06:50.230
Y-Yes. We have our own research on every possible field.

06:50.230 --> 06:53.610
Then I'd like the data on high school students.

06:53.610 --> 06:55.690
For every high school student in Japan.

06:55.690 --> 06:56.900
Certainly.

06:56.900 --> 06:59.610
This is going to be a long night.

07:09.620 --> 07:14.290
Kid not arrested; Detective Hakuba's losing streak continues.

07:15.330 --> 07:17.710
Too bad, useless detective.

07:23.180 --> 07:24.130
Oh, dear…

07:31.520 --> 07:33.850
Good morning!!!

07:33.850 --> 07:35.850
Kaito!!!

07:35.850 --> 07:39.570
Why are you being so noisy this early in the morning?!

07:39.570 --> 07:41.940
You were the one who was sleeping all morning!

07:41.940 --> 07:43.940
The first hour of class is over already!

07:44.320 --> 07:46.200
If you sleep too much, you'll get stupid.

07:46.200 --> 07:47.780
Leave me alone.

07:47.780 --> 07:50.330
I'm tired from all the work these past days.

07:54.790 --> 07:57.210
H-He's tired.

07:57.580 --> 07:59.960
Hakuba-<i>kun</i>, you're unusually late.

08:00.670 --> 08:03.920
You look awfully tired, Mr. Detective.

08:03.920 --> 08:07.590
Well, if you keep letting Kid get away,
of course it'll tire you out!

08:08.430 --> 08:09.930
Not as much as it will for you.

08:09.930 --> 08:12.850
What's this? What a nasty look.

08:13.310 --> 08:15.140
Well I'm all fired up!

08:15.140 --> 08:16.770
'Cause you were sleeping this whole time.

08:16.770 --> 08:18.360
Whatever.

08:18.360 --> 08:23.990
You're invited to the Ōshima Art Museum,
the last location in Kid's serial notice.

08:25.400 --> 08:28.160
Or is there some reason you wouldn't be able to come?

08:28.160 --> 08:32.490
C-Could it be… He knows who I am?!

08:32.490 --> 08:35.710
As if. It'll be easier to steal this way.

08:36.160 --> 08:38.040
Yeah, I'll go.

08:38.040 --> 08:40.130
I'd like to have a look at your skill!

08:40.130 --> 08:40.880
Yeah.

08:42.340 --> 08:44.800
That sounds great! I wanna go too!

08:44.800 --> 08:45.670
Why's that?

08:45.670 --> 08:48.220
I'm gonna catch Kid with my own hands!

08:48.220 --> 08:49.300
Why, you…

08:50.430 --> 08:51.470
You're trapped…

08:51.470 --> 08:51.970
You can't!

08:52.890 --> 08:55.810
Kuroba-<i>kun</i>! Give up on going.

08:56.810 --> 08:58.100
Come with me for a second!

08:58.100 --> 08:59.400
H-Hey, Akako.

09:01.270 --> 09:05.940
S-She really <i>is</i> beautiful. So her name's Akako-<i>san</i>…

09:06.780 --> 09:08.240
I don't have enough data…

09:09.620 --> 09:12.280
Ouch. Lemme go already.

09:12.280 --> 09:14.080
Be quiet and come with me.

09:14.080 --> 09:15.330
Say, say, where are you going?

09:16.580 --> 09:18.460
We have a little something we need to talk about.

09:18.460 --> 09:20.210
We do <i>not</i>.

09:20.210 --> 09:21.420
<i>I</i> do!

09:21.840 --> 09:22.590
Kaito!

09:23.050 --> 09:25.760
Don't do anything weird to Akako-<i>chan</i>!

09:30.930 --> 09:32.100
A trap?

09:32.100 --> 09:32.550
That's right.

09:32.550 --> 09:35.970
It's a trap by Hakuba-<i>kun</i> to catch you!

09:35.970 --> 09:38.940
Why's he gotta catch me?

09:38.940 --> 09:40.730
You're <i>still</i> playing dumb?!

09:40.730 --> 09:42.810
I have no clue what you're talking about.

09:43.730 --> 09:44.780
Then…

09:44.780 --> 09:49.570
<i>If</i> you are Kaitō Kid, give up on going!

09:53.830 --> 09:54.950
I'm not giving up.

09:55.990 --> 10:00.330
Even if I knew it was a trap, I've gotta take on a challenge.

10:00.750 --> 10:03.250
If I <i>was</i> Kaitō Kid, that is!

10:10.510 --> 10:13.010
Oh, class is starting.

10:13.010 --> 10:15.470
Gotta study, gotta study…

10:14.260 --> 10:15.470
Hold it!

10:20.060 --> 10:21.980
What a foolish guy!

10:21.980 --> 10:24.020
Get yourself caught for all I care!

10:24.020 --> 10:31.150
If you were to disappear from my sight, all the
men in the world would be captivated by me!

10:40.370 --> 10:44.710
But… If he really were to disappear…

10:46.670 --> 10:47.840
Kaito…

10:57.010 --> 10:59.890
Magic ball, show it all!

10:59.890 --> 11:04.350
What kind of trap has Saguru Hakuba set for Kid tonight?

11:16.580 --> 11:17.780
T-This is…?!

11:18.620 --> 11:19.780
Don't tell me <i>he</i> has…?!

11:19.780 --> 11:23.170
You mustn't, Akako-<i>han</i>! You mustn't go!

11:23.170 --> 11:25.130
It's incredibly frightning!

11:25.130 --> 11:27.000
That's enough. Silence.

11:57.130 --> 11:59.380
What is this?

11:59.380 --> 12:02.470
'The world's largest pink sapphire'...

12:02.470 --> 12:04.760
From talking to the art museum workers,

12:04.760 --> 12:08.350
it's part of a collection by a collector named J. P. Turner,

12:08.350 --> 12:16.940
a sculptor famous in Britain, who's obsessed with showing off his jewels one by one.

12:16.940 --> 12:20.030
I guess there's eccentrics everywhere...

12:20.030 --> 12:23.530
Even if it makes things difficult for us.

12:23.530 --> 12:25.070
Inspector!

12:25.070 --> 12:27.490
The preparations for that device are complete!

12:28.660 --> 12:30.790
Just you watch, Kid!

12:30.790 --> 12:32.750
Hiya, Dad!

12:32.750 --> 12:37.000
'Hiya'... Aoko, what're you doing here?

12:37.000 --> 12:38.250
And why is Kaito-<i>kun</i> here too?

12:38.250 --> 12:40.760
We were invited by Hakuba-<i>kun</i>!

12:40.760 --> 12:41.970
Invited?

12:41.970 --> 12:44.510
Welcome, Aoko-<i>san</i>.

12:44.510 --> 12:47.640
Wh-What's the meaning of this, Hakuba-<i>kun?</i>

12:47.640 --> 12:50.060
This isn't a party!

12:50.060 --> 12:54.600
I wanted the lady to see Kid's capture herself.

12:55.100 --> 12:57.860
That negligence will cost you your life!

12:57.860 --> 13:00.690
Yes, negligence is fatal.

13:00.690 --> 13:04.860
As he could already be among us.

13:08.120 --> 13:10.290
...If he is here, that is.

13:12.200 --> 13:17.040
Somehow, you're totally different from how you are at school, Hakuba-<i>kun</i>!

13:17.040 --> 13:20.460
You're like a detective! It's so cool!

13:20.460 --> 13:21.460
What is?

13:21.840 --> 13:23.460
Now, Aoko-<i>san</i>.

13:24.840 --> 13:27.470
It's dangerous here, so let's go upstairs.

13:28.470 --> 13:30.010
T-Thank you.

13:32.680 --> 13:36.520
That jerk's really getting carried away... Right now I...

13:36.520 --> 13:39.650
Hey, hurry up, Kaito!

13:39.650 --> 13:42.820
S-Sure! I've just gotta go to the toilet.

13:42.820 --> 13:43.990
Hurry, okay?

13:45.200 --> 13:46.660
It's leaking out!

13:46.660 --> 13:51.410
Now, I may have got in, but I've gotta hurry!

14:03.460 --> 14:07.760
You thought it was time for you to disguise yourself, but I won't let you.

14:08.640 --> 14:10.100
W-What do you mean?!

14:10.100 --> 14:13.270
I already know everything.

14:13.270 --> 14:14.270
What do you know?!

14:14.270 --> 14:21.190
From the hair that Kid left at the crime scene yesterday,
I identified that he is a high school student.

14:21.940 --> 14:29.780
When I compared Kid's data with the data of every
high school student in the country, one name leaped out.

14:30.450 --> 14:33.450
Kaito Kuroba, your name.

14:35.370 --> 14:37.830
It's just a mistake...

14:39.250 --> 14:43.550
I'll soon know, once Kaitō Kid's scheduled time comes.

14:45.050 --> 14:47.630
Inspector! One minute until the scheduled time!

14:53.060 --> 14:53.930
How's that?

14:55.810 --> 14:56.770
Again?

15:03.320 --> 15:04.780
You jerk!

15:04.780 --> 15:06.940
Inspector, it's time!

15:06.940 --> 15:10.320
Aww, and while I'm occupied with this...

15:10.320 --> 15:14.290
All right! Come on, Kid!

15:16.160 --> 15:19.250
What? He's not coming?

15:27.550 --> 15:30.590
It appears I win.

15:30.590 --> 15:32.930
Now, confess!

15:32.930 --> 15:34.640
Your identity, that is.

15:43.520 --> 15:45.320
Y-You!

15:47.190 --> 15:48.650
Kaitō Kid!

15:48.650 --> 15:49.530
What?!

15:49.530 --> 15:50.650
That can't be!

15:50.650 --> 15:54.330
Just as scheduled, I'll be taking the jewel!

15:56.370 --> 15:58.290
A-A broom?

16:02.790 --> 16:04.500
A-Amazing...

16:04.500 --> 16:07.300
Don't admire him, you moron!

16:07.800 --> 16:09.130
Get him!

16:09.130 --> 16:10.470
R-Right!

16:14.640 --> 16:15.430
Eeek!

16:18.560 --> 16:19.640
'Eeek'?

16:19.980 --> 16:21.310
Don't tell me that's...

16:25.860 --> 16:27.900
What? What happened?!

16:33.610 --> 16:35.910
Damn you, Kid!

16:35.910 --> 16:39.080
Really, what a nuisance Kid is.

16:42.370 --> 16:45.080
Kid... Could he be...?

16:45.080 --> 16:45.670
Above!

16:45.670 --> 16:47.420
Don't let him escape!

16:50.590 --> 16:51.760
This is...!

16:56.220 --> 16:57.850
That was close.

17:04.440 --> 17:05.310
It's coming...

17:16.070 --> 17:21.330
Let's play a little game, young lady.

17:32.460 --> 17:35.930
What... is this?

17:35.930 --> 17:39.050
Welcome to your nightmare.

17:39.970 --> 17:40.850
What?!

17:44.770 --> 17:48.440
A witch hunt? No, this is...

17:48.440 --> 17:53.360
Right, this is your nightmare.

17:53.360 --> 17:57.700
Your nightmare leads to your death.

18:06.830 --> 18:07.500
Akako?

18:23.970 --> 18:24.930
Akako!

18:26.310 --> 18:28.770
Hey, what happened?! Akako!

18:37.110 --> 18:39.160
Aka...ko...

18:47.210 --> 18:48.370
Good work.

18:49.000 --> 18:50.500
Miss Witch.

18:56.670 --> 19:00.050
What touching friendship.

19:01.890 --> 19:03.140
What?!

19:09.520 --> 19:10.560
Kid!

19:11.230 --> 19:12.690
Be gone!

19:17.070 --> 19:18.110
These are...

19:18.110 --> 19:19.360
I'm here.

19:33.710 --> 19:35.250
I'm your target, right?!

19:36.380 --> 19:39.380
Yes. If you <i>are</i> the real Kid.

19:39.380 --> 19:42.680
Though what is true and what is false?

19:42.680 --> 19:43.850
What?!

19:48.770 --> 19:51.940
It's fine. You are the current Kid.

19:51.940 --> 19:55.190
As Tōichi Kuroba is no longer part of this world.

19:56.190 --> 19:59.110
Don't tell me this guy's the one who got Dad...?!

20:02.450 --> 20:04.030
Spider!

20:04.030 --> 20:07.660
Also known as Günter von Goldberg II.

20:07.660 --> 20:12.920
You're publicly known as a world-famous illusionist, but that's not your true name.

20:12.920 --> 20:16.880
Your name is unknown, your nationality
is unknown, your age is unknown.

20:17.460 --> 20:20.130
But I'll make sure to unveil your identity!

20:20.130 --> 20:22.220
You are persistent.

20:24.140 --> 20:25.100
Get down!

20:35.150 --> 20:36.770
W-What was that?

20:38.440 --> 20:41.650
We'll meet again, Kid. Don't forget...

20:41.650 --> 20:44.740
The nightmare is always by your side.

21:01.760 --> 21:04.800
Phew, that was too close.

21:09.510 --> 21:12.430
He trapped <i>me</i> in an illusion?!

21:17.310 --> 21:19.270
Now I owe you nothing!

21:33.410 --> 21:36.290
Spider... I won't let you have him.

21:36.290 --> 21:40.500
Not you, not Hakuba, nor the police.

21:40.500 --> 21:43.720
As Kaito Kuroba will be captivated by me!

21:49.140 --> 21:51.470
Oh, Hakuba-<i>kun</i>! Where's Kid?

21:55.730 --> 21:56.810
Inspector?

21:56.810 --> 21:59.480
I found this stuck in a tree.

22:02.820 --> 22:04.820
Yet again?

22:09.530 --> 22:13.540
Inspector, don't you think that
there are actually two Kaitō Kids?

22:13.540 --> 22:16.670
No, you saw it! He rode on a broom, so he's a sorcerer!

22:16.670 --> 22:18.250
What're you all going on about?!

22:18.250 --> 22:20.380
Kaitō Kid is...

22:20.380 --> 22:22.130
K-Kaitō Kid is...?

22:23.340 --> 22:24.670
A crossdresser!

22:27.010 --> 22:27.970
Hey, hey...

22:37.520 --> 22:38.400
Dad...

22:52.910 --> 22:58.460
kimi ni zenzen kyōmi nai uso you are my perfect guy

22:52.910 --> 22:58.460
I’m not interested in you at all — I’m lying, you are my perfect guy

22:58.460 --> 23:03.210
tokimeki wa kakusenai honto wa ki ni natte shikatanai

22:58.460 --> 23:03.210
I can’t hide my beating heart, I’m really into you, I can’t help it

23:03.210 --> 23:08.180
koi ni bukiyō son'na style kimi no mae da to betsujin mitai

23:03.210 --> 23:08.180
I’m no good at love, with a bad style, I become someone else when facing you

23:08.180 --> 23:13.260
dare ni mo ienai himitsu no mama

23:08.180 --> 23:13.260
I don’t tell anyone about it

23:13.260 --> 23:17.940
soredemo I'm all right koi no yukue nante

23:13.260 --> 23:17.940
Still, I’m all right, love just isn’t for me

23:17.940 --> 23:22.520
mada it isn't the last chance for me

23:17.940 --> 23:22.520
and it still isn’t the last chance for me

23:22.520 --> 23:27.700
iron'na love story o egaite'ru mune no naka

23:22.520 --> 23:27.700
I have many love stories carved into my heart

23:27.700 --> 23:33.370
demo risō ni wa hodo tōi

23:27.700 --> 23:33.370
but they’re far from my ideals

23:33.370 --> 23:38.370
watashi-tte wagamama sore kurai no koto wakatte'ru

23:33.370 --> 23:38.370
I know I’m selfish but…

23:38.370 --> 23:45.090
dakedo nanika ikenai no?

23:38.370 --> 23:45.090
…is there anything wrong with that?

23:45.090 --> 23:50.260
kimi to no koi ni koi o shite'ru dake de

23:45.090 --> 23:50.260
Just being in love with you is enough

23:50.260 --> 23:55.220
tsutaetakutemo mada

23:50.260 --> 23:55.220
I couldn’t confess even if I wanted to…

23:55.220 --> 24:00.310
himitsu ni shite'ru hō ga shiawase dakara

23:55.220 --> 24:00.310
I’m happier with it being a secret

24:00.310 --> 24:08.000
ima wa watashi dake no secret love

24:00.310 --> 24:08.000
so for now, it’ll be my secret love

24:08.710 --> 24:12.920
Now then, next week is the turn of yours truly, Kaitō Kid!

24:12.920 --> 24:15.800
A French phantom thief named
<i>chat noir</i> suddenly appeared!

24:15.800 --> 24:22.140
Covering himself in a jet-black costume, he wants a clear standoff with the pure-white Kid?!

24:22.140 --> 24:26.140
The two thieves' goal is Marie Antoinette's ring, the Golden Eye.

24:26.140 --> 24:28.430
The Inspector's risking his own life for it,

24:28.430 --> 24:32.110
but I'm sorry, Aoko, I can't afford to lose this battle!

24:32.110 --> 24:38.030
The Reminiscent Golden Eye

24:32.110 --> 24:35.190
Next time: 'The Reminiscent Golden Eye'.

24:35.190 --> 24:38.030
Let's meet under the moonlight.

24:38.030 --> 24:43.030
Next Kid's Magic: Black Cat!

24:43.030 --> 24:44.990
Seems Kaitō Kid's quite handsome.

24:44.990 --> 24:46.540
Then he's a handsome crossdresser!

24:46.540 --> 24:48.040
Why?!
